<title>PHILIPPINES: Aboitiz buys back own shares.</title>
<headline>Aboitiz buys back own shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aboitiz Equity Ventures Inc said it has purchased an additional 16,459,680 of its own shares.</p>
<p>Aboitiz Equity's assistant corporate secretary Sylvia Paderanga told Reuters on Friday the company earlier bought 707,000 AEV shares.</p>
<p>Paderanga said the company may still buy more shares but could not disclose the amount and the prices at which the shares were bought.</p>
<p>The board of directors of AEV approved the buyback of shares last June 9 to improve the company's earnings per share.</p>
<p>AEV is engaged in power generation, transportation and financial services.</p>
<p>AEV rose six centavos to 1.96 pesos in early trade on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
